  <div class="detail">White's win rate stays within a narrow band across bullet/blitz/rapid/classical, but the <em>victory type</em> distribution shifts dramatically. Bullet sees far more timeouts; classical sees more checkmates and draws. Coaches should note that bullet outcomes are less positionally determined.</div>
</div>

<div class="finding-box">
